    "description": "AL-2: Deal Context Fields\n\nSurface read-only Deal context on the Link record so reps don't have to click through to the Deal to see it.\n\nFIELDS\n\nOperator (lookup, read-only)\n\nPartner (lookup, read-only)\n\nMarket — combined flag + Country/State display\n\nVertical (picklist, read-only)\n\nDeal Status (picklist, read-only)\n\nPriority Tier (picklist, read-only): Primary, Secondary\n\nDefault Redirect URL (read-only)\n\nIMPLEMENTATION REQUIREMENTS\n\nMirrors the Deal doc's DL-1/DL-2 fields, shown read-only for context — not re-documented in full on this ticket\n\nSee [BUILD-212 — Deal: Object + Core Details](https://app.asana.com/0/0/1217693597664441/f/) (DL-1: Deal Object + Core Details) and [BUILD-213 — Deal: Commercial Terms](https://app.asana.com/0/0/1217706886406370/f/) (DL-2: Commercial Terms) for the underlying field definitions\n\nVertical and Deal Status option lists are still not fully enumerated anywhere in the source material\n\nNOTES\n\nProvenance: AL-2 (Affiliate Link Record User Stories doc).\n\nSOURCE\n\n[https://docs.google.com/document/d/1MsJXwt3oY-DyQuAdMzNYlyPenKUQl7g8mHzMmeRaVHs/edit?tab=t.nyoinaymgezg](https://docs.google.com/document/d/1MsJXwt3oY-DyQuAdMzNYlyPenKUQl7g8mHzMmeRaVHs/edit?tab=t.nyoinaymgezg)\n\nDependencies: [BUILD-220 — Affiliate Link: Link Core Fields](https://app.asana.com/0/0/1217693636693194/f/), [BUILD-212 — Deal: Object + Core Details](https://app.asana.com/0/0/1217693597664441/f/)\n\nOwner (proposed): Taryn Reithofer\n\nCreated 2026-08-20 from Affiliate Link record documentation review.",
